{"id": 4551, "title": "My good friend", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK2"], "slug": "my-good-friend", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/4551_my-good-friend.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["我的好朋友名字叫陈陈。他喜欢喝酒，我喜欢运动。小学和中学，我们都是一个班的同学。大学我们不在一个学校，但是我们还在一个城市生活。后来他去了杭州工作，我去了上海，但是我们还是经常见面。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["我的好朋友名字叫陳陳。他喜歡喝酒，我喜歡運動。小學和中學，我們都是一個班的同學。大學我們不在一個學校，但是我們還在一個城市生活。後來他去了杭州工作，我去了上海，但是我們還是經常見面。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["wǒ de hǎo péng you míng zi jiào Chén Chén。 tā xǐ huan hē jiǔ， wǒ xǐ huan yùn dòng。 xiǎo xué hé zhōng xué， wǒ men dōu shì yī gè bān de tóng xué。 dà xué wǒ men bù zài yī gè xué xiào， dàn shì wǒ men hái zài yī gè chéng shì shēng huó。 hòu lái tā qù le Háng zhōu gōng zuò， wǒ qù le Shàng hǎi， dàn shì wǒ men hái shi jīng cháng jiàn miàn。"], "english_paragraphs": ["My good friend's name is Chen Chen. He likes to drink and I like to play sports. In primary school and middle school, we were all classmates in the same class. We are not in the same university, but we still live in the same city. Later he went to Hangzhou to work and I went to Shanghai, but we still met often."], "english_full": "My good friend's name is Chen Chen. He likes to drink and I like to play sports. In primary school and middle school, we were all classmates in the same class. We are not in the same university, but we still live in the same city. Later he went to Hangzhou to work and I went to Shanghai, but we still met often.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (of; &#x27;s) / modifying particle (used after an attribute to modify a noun or to form a nominal expression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hǎo\" data-defn=\"(of two people) close; on intimate terms\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"péng you\" data-defn=\"friend\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">朋友</span><span class=\"tr\">朋友</span><rt>péng you</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"míng zi\" data-defn=\"name (of a person or thing)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">名字</span><span class=\"tr\">名字</span><rt>míng zi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jiào\" data-defn=\"to be called\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">叫</span><span class=\"tr\">叫</span><rt>jiào</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Chén Chén\" data-defn=\"a personal name; Chen Chen\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">陈陈</span><span class=\"tr\">陳陳</span><rt>Chén Chén</rt></ruby>。<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tā\" data-defn=\"he; him; his\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">他</span><span class=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xǐ huan\" data-defn=\"to like; to be fond of\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">喜欢</span><span class=\"tr\">喜歡</span><rt>xǐ huan</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hē\" data-defn=\"to drink\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">喝</span><span class=\"tr\">喝</span><rt>hē</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jiǔ\" data-defn=\"wine (esp. rice wine) / liquor / spirits / alcoholic beverage\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">酒</span><span class=\"tr\">酒</span><rt>jiǔ</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xǐ huan\" data-defn=\"to like; to be fond of\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">喜欢</span><span class=\"tr\">喜歡</span><rt>xǐ huan</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yùn dòng\" data-defn=\"to exercise / sports / exercise\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">运动</span><span class=\"tr\">